Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:41.64,Hook,,0,0,0,,FURIA AL VOLANTE EN\NGTA 6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Oigan, tengo a un loco del\Ntráfico detrás de mí
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:03.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Oye, oye, oye, ya me\Ncansaste, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:05.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Bájate del puto carro,\Nbájate del
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:06.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}carro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:08.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Vamos, ven acá.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.04,0:00:08.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:09.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Vamos a hablar aquí, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:13.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¿Ah, sí? ¿Estás seguro?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.98,0:00:15.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—A ver si peleas por mi\Nhonor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.26,0:00:18.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Epa, epa, epa, ¿qué\Ndijiste?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:20.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Cierra la boca. —Sí,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:22.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}yo te voy a cerrar la\Nboca, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:22.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me tienes harto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:24.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Eres un maldito...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:26.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Hora del suplex!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.90,0:00:31.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡No te vas, no te vas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.06,0:00:31.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}no te vas!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:35.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Dices que no?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:38.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Ay, maldición!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:39.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Mierda!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.22,0:00:40.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Arranca, arranca!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:41.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Vámonos!
